lc3: a Rust port of the LC3 codec from liblc3 1.1.3.

This product includes software derived from liblc3 (https://github.com/google/liblc3):
  Copyright 2022 Google LLC
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

This copy is a modified no_std port of lc3 0.1.0 (crates.io, Apache-2.0) for the birdscannerLE
firmware: `#![no_std]` + `alloc`, `libm` for sqrtf/truncf/floorf, the x86-64 SSE2 kernels
(src/simd.rs) removed in favour of their portable paths, on-stack MDCT buffers sized for 480
samples instead of 960.
